    "body": {
      "data": "Joyce,\n\nLanding the final constraints for the patrons' evening venue pick before the weekend, so you have one written trail to work from.\n\nDate: Saturday 14 November 2026, arrival from 19:00.\nConfirmed invited guest count: 180 patrons and partners.\nBudget ceiling for venue hire only: EUR 12,000 net of catering. Anything at or above EUR 12,001 needs board sign-off, which we will not seek at this hour.\nCuratorial fit: the room should carry the Vienna 1900 mood on its own bones; Secessionist and Jugendstil interiors count, a neutral hotel ballroom does not.\nAvailability check: only rooms with a confirmed hold on the shared calendar for 14 November are in scope; if the hold is missing or shows a conflict, treat the venue as unavailable.\n\nThe four rooms already on the shortlist are on the comparison sheet in the shared Documents folder (file_11). Please rank them against the constraints above and return the pick as a one-page visual for Stefan and Margarethe by Monday.\n\nNote: the 22 October pencil memo from Ansgar in the fundraising thread pre-dates the guest list closing; those numbers are stale and should not drive the pick.\n\nWarm regards,\nKlara Winter\nHead of Development // Osterreichisches Kunstmuseum",
      "size": 1219
    },
    "mimeType": "text/plain"
  }
}

